[2m4. FUZZY[0m [34mmap_set[0m [2m(Maps)[0m
   [32mA new map with key bound to value; the original is unchanged, like every                  olang value.[0m
   [35mSyntax:[0m [36mmap_set(map, key, value)[0m

[2m5. FUZZY[0m [34mmap_set_in[0m [2m(Maps)[0m
   [32mA copy with the value at the end of the key path set: each level a new value of its own kind, a missing level a new map. A level nothing else holds is written in place, as map_set's sole-owner write.[0m
   [35mSyntax:[0m [36mmap_set_in(value, keys, v)[0m

[2m6. FUZZY[0m [34mmap_update[0m [2m(Maps)[0m
   [32mA copy with key set to f(the old value) — f is given Unit for an absent key. The old value is moved into f when nothing else holds the map.[0m
   [35mSyntax:[0m [36mmap_update(value, key, f)[0m

[2m7. FUZZY[0m [34mmap_get[0m [2m(Maps)[0m
   [32mThe value under key, or Unit () when the key is absent — a missing key is                  not an error. Reads maps, structs, objects, and parsed JSON uniformly.[0m
   [35mSyntax:[0m [36mmap_get(map, key)[0m

[2m8. FUZZY[0m [34mmap_get_in[0m [2m(Maps)[0m
   [32mThe value at the end of a key path, or Unit at the first missing hop — map_set_in's reading half.[0m
   [35mSyntax:[0m [36mmap_get_in(value, keys)[0m

[2m9. FUZZY[0m [34mmap_get_or[0m [2m(Maps)[0m
